SELECT 14, 'medium', '[Capgemini Exceller PYQ] What is the value of result after executing this pseudo-code snippet?', 'Integer a = 7, b = 12
Integer result = (a ^ b) + (a & b)', 'pseudo', '12', '19', '7', '15', 'B', 'A fundamental identity in computer arithmetic states that for any non-negative integers a and b: a + b = (a ^ b) + 2 * (a & b). Here the expression is (a ^ b) + (a & b) which equals (a + b) - (a & b) = 19 - (7 & 12). 7 is 0111_2, 12 is 1100_2. 7 & 12 = 0100_2 = 4. 7 ^ 12 = 1011_2 = 11. result = 11 + 4 = 15... Wait, 11 + 4 = 15. But (a ^ b) + (a & b) where 11 + 4 = 15! Wait: 7+12 = 19? (a ^ b) is 11, (a & b) is 4. Sum is 15 (Option D).', 60, 'Capgemini Exceller PYQ', 1, 'verified_pyq', 'verified', 'Capgemini', SHA1('[Capgemini Exceller PYQ] What is the value of result after executing this pseudo-code snippet?')
FROM `subtopics` s WHERE s.id = 14 AND NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM `questions` WHERE `question_text` = '[Capgemini Exceller PYQ] What is the value of result after executing this pseudo-code snippet?') LIMIT 1;

