SELECT 10, 'medium', '[UST Style Practice] In a corporate security code, if ''SECURE'' is coded as ''TFDVSF'', what is the code for ''SYSTEM''?', NULL, 'lr', 'TZTUFN', 'TFTUFN', 'TZTUNF', 'SZTUFN', 'A', 'Each letter is shifted forward by +1: S(+1)=T, E(+1)=F, C(+1)=D, U(+1)=V, R(+1)=S, E(+1)=F. Applying +1 to SYSTEM: S->T, Y->Z, S->T, T->U, E->F, M->N. Result is TZTUFN (Option A).', 45, 'UST Style Practice', 1, 'verified_pyq', 'verified', 'UST', SHA1('[UST Style Practice] In a corporate security code, if ''SECURE'' is coded as ''TFDVSF'', what is the code for ''SYSTEM''?')
